  "name": "Basic Truffles",
  "recipe_type": "dessert",
  "brief_description": "This truffle recipe makes a rich chocolate ganache that you can roll into truffles or use to fill chocolate candy molds for decadent homemade treats.",
  "cuisine": "American",
  "instructions": [
    {
      "position": 1,
      "text": "Combine chocolate and cream in a medium saucepan over medium heat; cook, stirring, until chocolate is melted and mixture is smooth. Remove from heat and whisk in vanilla. Pour into a small dish and refrigerate until set, but not hard, 1 \u00bd to 2 hours."
    }
